\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar rallies against yen on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  talk. \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juli 1999\par 15:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, July 20 (Reuters) - The dollar rallied against the yen on Tuesday with dealers in London citing talk that the U.S. Federal Reserve was buying dollars above 118 yen. \par \par \uc2  Talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came a day after the dollar fell 2.75 percent against the yen to a low of 117.68 yen, its weakest since June 10. That was the first time last month that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent yen strength from derailing the country's economic recovery. \par \par \uc2  A Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  official in New York said the Fed had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on its behalf, selling yen for dollars. This was the first time that the BOJ has conducted \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  via another \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  since June 18 when it bought euros for yen via the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers in London said the Fed had bought dollars for yen over an electronic broking system but added that the amounts purchased over the system appeared to be small. Others said it had also dealt directly with certain banks in New York. \par \par \uc2  The dollar shot as high as 119.68 yen in the wake of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  talk, but had subsided to 119.40/50 by 1334 GMT. The euro gained in the dollar's wake, rising as high as 124.06 yen from overnight lows of 121.54. \par \par \uc2  ((Swaha Pattanaik, London Capital Markets, +44 171 542 6284, swaha.pattanaik@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \p