\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  CROSS - Euro tumbles vs yen after Hax comments. \b0\par\par\uc2 569 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juli 1999\par 05:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, July 19 (Reuters) - The euro was down sharply against the yen at midday in Tokyo on Monday, hitting fresh lifetime lows as confidence in the single European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was undermined by reported comments by European officials over the weekend. \par \par \uc2  The euro was at 121.98/05 yen at 0303 GMT, compared with 123.43 yen in New York late on Friday. \par \par \uc2  The euro briefly dropped as low as 121.88 yen, which was down 9.8 percent from a lifetime high of 135.10 yen set on the day it made its debut on January 4. \par \par \uc2  A wave of stop-loss selling was triggered after the euro dipped below the previous record low of 122.63 yen set on June 18, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Herbert Hax, chairman of the German government's economic advisory council, was quoted by the Welt am Sonntag newspaper on Sunday as saying the euro could soon fall below parity with the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "That can happen," the paper quoted Hax as saying, referring to a euro fall below one dollar. \par \par \uc2  But Hax also said that such an event should not be viewed as much more than a "psychological signal" and that a "serious alarm signal it is not." \par \par \uc2  Separately, Eugenio Domingo Solans, a board member of the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (ECB), was quoted by Spanish newspaper El Mundo on Sunday as saying the ECB would not raise interest rates to help the euro. \par \par \uc2  "Last week, the euro gained on comments by (ECB President Wim) Duisenberg, which were interpreted by the market as signalling future credit tightening," said a dealer at a city bank. \par \par \uc2  "But Domingo's comments poured cold water on such expectations," he added. \par \par \uc2  Duisenberg said last Thursday that "a bias may be creeping into our considerations," but stopped short of saying that the ECB was officially leaning toward credit tightening. \par \par \uc2  Euro selling on Monday was initiated by overseas fund operators, and later joined by Japanese exporters and investors as the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) failed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the yen's strength, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell yen for the euro via the ECB on June 18 and 21. \par \par \uc2  Options-related sales were also cited as causing a sharp euro drop against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday. \par \par \uc2  "With the euro's drop below one dollar seen increasingly likely in the not-so-distant future, some Japanese players moved to dump euro," said a dealer at a trust bank. \par \par \uc2  But not all players were so bearish about the euro, saying that current levels offered attractive bargain-hunting opportunities for long-term investors. \par \par \uc2  "There is still some chance that upcoming economic data releases in Europe will show signs of the economy bottoming out. So I'd be cautious about selling too aggressively before tomorrow's Ifo data release," said a dealer at another city bank. \par \par \uc2  The Munich-based economics institute Ifo will release its business climate survey for June at 0800 GMT on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  In May, the key western German business climate index in the survey rose to 90.4 from 89.7 in April. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the Swiss franc was at 75.89/94 yen, compared with 76.78 yen in New York. \par \par \uc2  Sterling was at 187.71/83 yen, versus 189.04 yen in New York. ((Tokyo Treasury Desk 81-3-3432-9780 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv7j047ru\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
