\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  Conducted Small  \highlight22\uc2 Fx Intervention \highlight\uc2  Thu Evening -Nikkei \b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Juli 1999\par 01:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Nikkei)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Thursday evening, selling yen to shore up the dollar, the Nihon Keizai Shimbun reported in its Friday morning edition. \par \par \uc2  The small-scale \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was conducted through selected banks to stop the greenback falling below Y120 when it hit Y120.25, according to the business newspaper. \par \par \uc2  The action is seen as a sign Japanese monetary authorities want to protect the earnings and stock prices of export firms, to avoid any setback to economic recovery. \par \par \uc2  The MOF and the BOJ last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the yen appreciating on July 5, immediately after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  released its June tankan survey of business sentiment. The diffusion index of business confidence for major manufacturers showed a 10-point improvement over the March survey. \par \par \uc2  Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  pushed the dollar as high as Y121.40, but the limited scale later encouraged covering of short yen positions, sending the dollar to a range of Y120.50-Y121.00. At 5 p.m. local time (0800 GMT), the dollar traded at Y120.90-93. \par \par \uc2  "We will pay more attention than before to movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and take appropriate action when necessary," Nobuaki Usui, administrative vice finance minister, said Thursday evening. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 15-07-99 \par \par \uc2  2325GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv7f05ajm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
