\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar teeters, support shored up by BOJ fears. \b0\par\par\uc2 570 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juli 1999\par 06:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, July 15 (Reuters) - The dollar was teetering just above key support at the midession as the threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  shored up otherwise shaky sentiment. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the natural weight of flows in the market was to the sell side, in part reflecting aggressive offshore demand for Japanese equities. But the dollar was now at levels where the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the past, so speculators were wary of going short outright. \par \par \uc2  That allowed support under 120.50 yen to hold for the moment, aided by bids from Japanese public funds, and at 0300 GMT the dollar was at 120.60/65 compared with 120.60/70 in New York. \par \par \uc2  Dollar sellers had been mildly encouraged this morning by reports Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa had said that 120 yen was not a level to worry about. \par \par \uc2  Miyazawa later called those reports a "nuisance" and said there was no change in the policy of taking decisive action against any drastic rise in the yen. \par \par \uc2  That was enough to get the bears to back off for the moment, but dealers felt it was only a matter of time before the market tested the BOJ's breaking point. "The plan for many is to keep probing until the BOJ buys, and then sell into the rally," said one, noting this approach had worked well in recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  five times in as many weeks and after every episode the dollar has drifted off again, so prompting another round of official buying. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there was much second-guessing about where the BOJ would decide to act this time. Some thought it would come as soon as 120.25, which is a major technical support level, while others argued it would allow a fall toward 118.90 in the hope of catching the market painfully short. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also on the minds of euro traders after rumours the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was selling two-year Treasuries, presumably to ready funds for dollar selling. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that, with the governing council of the ECB meeting later on Thursday, the market is cautious in case it uses the regular post-meeting press conference to offer more than just verbal support for the ailing euro. \par \par \uc2  The hapless \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was waiting nervously at $1.0213/23 at the midsession, having firmed to $1.0205/10 in New York from Wednesday's low of $1.0122. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the bounce broke trendline resistance and offered the chance of a more substantial recovery, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  needed to clear stiff resistance around $1.0250 and $1.0295 to convince the many doubters. \par \par \uc2  Euro/yen enjoyed a similar bounce to stand at 123.21/36 yen, after toying with lifetime lows around 122.55 overnight. \par \par \uc2  But again dealers suspected it was merely speculators taking profits on short positions and the overall trend remained downward to the next chart target at 121.70. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, sterling was up at $1.5636/46 after a 1-cent short-covering rally overnight but was having trouble with chart resistance at $1.5650. \par \par \uc2  Analysts emphasised that, in this case as well, the rise looked merely like a correction in a downtrend and they expected it to be contained by major resistance at $1.5695. ((Wayne Cole, Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 3432 8584 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv7f04nlp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
